  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 200°C.",
    "In a large bowl toss mushrooms, potatoes, cauliflower, onion, garlic, and ginger with coconut oil, cumin, coriander, turmeric, garam masala, and salt until well coated.",
    "Spread the mixture in a single layer on a rimmed baking sheet.",
    "Roast for 25 minutes, stirring once, until vegetables are golden and tender.",
    "Remove from oven and let rest 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Optional: sprinkle fresh coriander or lime juice before serving.",
    "Serve hot as a main dish or side."
